### Login de usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prueba4@test.cl",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token); %}

### GET Usuarios (Requiere de Token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### GET Ventas (Requiere de Token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ventas
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### POST Ventas (Requiere 'ADMIN')
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ventas?usuarioId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  1,
  2
]

### POST de Productos (Requiere 'ADMIN')
POST http://localhost:8080/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Comida gato",
  "descripcion": "Comida con salmón",
  "precio": 20000,
  "stock": 15,
  "categoria": "Alimento gato"
}

